registration under different schemes of this FTP.', 'Profile of Importer / Exporter governs how DGFT business controls should be applied, validated, and enforced.', 'Profile of Importer / Exporter explains the operating rule set that DEKAI should enforce. Key control points include IEC Holder shall be
