validity has expired while in custody of Customs Authority / RA / Government
Authority.');
INSERT INTO workflows (section_code, step_index, step_text) VALUES ('2.20', 12, 'Handle exception: (c) However, revalidation of freely transferable authorisation / duty credit scrips and
