was issued.', '[9, 10]', '["for", "may", "any", "not", "the", "iii", "was", "HBP", "six", "but", "his", "had", "copy", "lost", "made", "with", "self", "days", "from", "date"]', 'Support Duplicate copies of Export / Import Authorisation processing and compliance validation.', '["2.23", "Duplicate copies of Export / Import Authorisation", "business-rule", "document-driven", "dgft"]');
