31.10.2017.');
INSERT INTO exceptions (section_code, exception_text) VALUES ('2.23', 'However, request must be made to RA concerned within a month from the date of
final acceptance of Authorisation/Scrip in the Customs Server.');
INSERT INTO exceptions (section_code, exception_text) VALUES ('2.23', 'Notwithstanding anything contained above, these provisions of revalidation shall not
apply wherever, the authorisation/scrip holder had clear 6 months period in hand for
utilisation.');
