shall be allowed without an Authorisation on submission of a bond/ security
to Customs or ATA Carnet.', 'Indha Exhibits Required for National and International Exhibitions or Fairs section-la, Exhibits required for National and International Exhibitions or Fairs explains the operating rule set that DEKAI should enforce. Key control points include 2.60 Exhibits required for National and International Exhibitions or Fairs
and Demonstration
