Federation of Indian Exporters Organization (FIEO).');
INSERT INTO workflows (section_code, step_index, step_text) VALUES ('2.80', 3, 'Evaluate condition: (c) In respect of multi product exporters having their head office/ registered office
in the North Eastern States, RCMC may be obtained from Shellac & Forest Products
Export Promotion Council (except for the products looked after by APEDA, Spices
Board and Tea Board).');
INSERT INTO workflows (section_code, step_index, step_text) VALUES ('2.80', 4, '2.80 Applying for RCMC
(a) While applying for RCMC, an exporter has to declare his main line of business in
the application.');
INSERT INTO workflows (section_code, step_index, step_text) VALUES ('2.80', 5, 'The exporter is required to obtain RCMC from the Council which is
concerned with the product of his main line of business.');
INSERT INTO workflows (section_code, step_index, step_text) VALUES ('2.80', 6, '(b) In case an export product is not covered by any Export Promotion
Council/Commodity Board etc., RCMC in respect thereof is to be obtained from FIEO.');
INSERT INTO workflows (section_code, step_index, step_text) VALUES ('2.80', 7, 'Further, in case of multi product exporters, not registered with any EPC, where main
line of business is yet to be settled, the exporter has an option to obtain RCMC from
Federation of Indian Exporters Organization (FIEO).');
INSERT INTO workflows (section_code, step_index, step_text) VALUES ('2.80', 8, '(c) In respect of multi product exporters having their head office/ registered office
in the North Eastern States, RCMC may be obtained from Shellac & Forest Products
Export Promotion Council (except for the products looked after by APEDA, Spices
Board and Tea Board).');
INSERT INTO workflows (section_code, step_index, step_text) VALUES ('2.80', 9, '(d) In respect of exporters of handicrafts and handloom products from the UTs of
Jammu & Kashmir and Ladakh, Director, Handicrafts, Government of Jammu &
Kashmir is authorised to issue RCMC.');
INSERT INTO workflows (section_code, step_index, step_text) VALUES ('2.80', 10, 'Run validation: The exporter is required to obtain RCMC from the Council which is
concerned with the product of his main line of business.');
INSERT INTO workflows (section_code, step_index, step_text) VALUES ('2.80', 11, 'Handle exception: (c) In respect of multi product exporters having their head office/ registered office
in the North Eastern States, RCMC may be obtained from Shellac & Forest Products
Export Promotion Council (except for the products looked after by APEDA, Spices
Board and Tea Board).');
