clubbed, whether such authorisations are valid or not.', 'business_rule', 'Facility of Clubbing of Authorisations', 'Any exports made beyond 48 months of
earliest authorisation shall not be acceptable for clubbing.iv
(vii) Exports made during initial or extended EO period of individual
authorisations (after payment of composition fee as per provisions of Para
4.40 of HBP) shall be clubbed.', '(vi) Only such authorisations shall be clubbed which have been issued within 24
months from the date of issue of earliest authorisation that is sought to be
clubbed, whether such authorisations are valid or not.', 'This is further subject to condition that upon clubbing
