quantity of exports of an Advance Authorisation.');
INSERT INTO conditions (section_code, condition_text) VALUES ('4.37', '(b) Request for pro-rata enhancement in value and quantity may be made either
before or after exports.');
INSERT INTO conditions (section_code, condition_text) VALUES ('4.37', 'In such cases where there is a change in SION prior to
export of said product, pro-rata enhancement shall be given after calculating
entitlement on revised SION.');
INSERT INTO conditions (section_code, condition_text) VALUES ('4.37', '(c) Application for the enhancement in CIF or FOB value of Authorisation
/reduction in the value of Authorisation / EOP Extension / Revalidation of
Authorisation shall be filed online in ANF 4D to concerned Regional
Authority.');
