along with interest thereon as notified, or affect additional export within
the Export Obligation period.', 'business_rule', 'Regularisation of Bonafide Default', 'Export Obligation is not fulfilled both in terms of quantity and value', '(e) In case an exporter is unable to complete Export Obligation undertaken
