issued for import of drugs from unregistered sources with pre import
condition.', 'However, the Authorisation holder shall
pay customs duty with applicable interest to the Custom Authority
on unutilized quantity imported under Advance Authorisation.', 'DEKAI should produce a compliance decision for 4.49 - Regularisation of Bonafide Default.');
