i. For the purpose of import, the validity of DIA is 12 months from the date of
issuance of Authorisation.
ii. Period of fulfilment of export obligation is 18 months from the date of
issuance of Authorisation.
iii. Only one authorisation is allowed for one IEC for a particular financial year.
iv. No ARO/Invalidation letter/Certificate of supply (Co S) is allowed against DIA.
