developed by it through other exporter, or any other EOU / EHTP/ STP / BTP /
SEZ unit subject to condition that:
a) Goods shall be produced in EOU / EHTP / STP / BTP unit concerned.', 'Indha Export through Other Exporters section-la, 6.19 export through Other Exporters
