‘Invalidation Letter / ARO wise’ against individual Authorisation within the
time limit as specified above.', 'Frequency of application and time period for claiming TED / governs how DGFT business controls should be applied, validated, and enforced.', 'Frequency of application and time period for claiming TED / explains the operating rule set that DEKAI should enforce. Key control points include Claims should be filed within a period of twelve months
from date of receipt of supplies by project authority or from date of receipt
