imported SCOMET items to the same foreign entity or to its OEM
(including agencies authorized by OEM)
i.', 'Indha Issue of export authorisations for re-export/return of section-la, 10.14 Issue of export authorisations for re-export/return of
imported SCOMET items to the same foreign entity or to its OEM
(including agencies authorized by OEM)
i.', '10.14 Issue of export authorisations for re-export/return of
imported SCOMET items to the same foreign entity or to its OEM
(including agencies authorized by OEM)
